From 311a103250d2c5d58334d1cbddeaa3e621d37444 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Francois Massot-Pellet <francois.massot-pellet@nxp.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 09:57:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add RFNM board support (rfnm transport)

rfnm_port.RfnmPort is a drop-in for selfhosted.M4Proxy on RFNM boards:
it finds CCSR/TCML/TCMU through the la9310shiva modinfo ioctl, maps them
through /dev/mem, and sends VSPA debug requests as LA9310_SW_CMD_VSPA_DBG
sw_cmds (HIF sw_cmd_desc, MSG unit 2 doorbell, up to 28 words each).

- vdbg/profile/DAP: --transport rfnm
- rfnm_port.py: selfhosted.py verbs (heartbeat, info, load, ...) on RFNM
- vdbg/vdbg_dap: wire the DWARF print command from vspadwarf
- tests/test_rfnm_port.py: offline tests against a simulated M4
- docs/rfnm.md and README entries

Developed with AI assistance (Claude).

Signed-off-by: Francois Massot-Pellet <francois.massot-pellet@nxp.com>
